--- !u!114 &1274326168303862403
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3752300061302600148}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "<align=center><b>RUO\u2019OT</b></align>\n\nRuo\u2019ot ovat kosteikon t\xE4rkeimpi\xE4
      kasveja. Ne sitovat ravinteita, puhdistavat vett\xE4 ja tarjoavat suojaa monille
      el\xE4imille. Lis\xE4ksi ne est\xE4v\xE4t eroosiota.\n\n\n\n\n\nJ\xE4rviruoko\n\nJ\xE4rviruoko
      on korkea \nkasvi, joka muodostaa \ntiheit\xE4 ruovikkoja rannoille. \nSe levi\xE4\xE4
      tehokkaasti \njuurakon avulla ja \nviihtyy reheviss\xE4 vesiss\xE4."
    sw: "<align=center><b>VASSV\xC4XTER</b></align>\n\nVassv\xE4xter \xE4r bland
      de viktigaste v\xE4xterna i v\xE5tmarker. De binder n\xE4rings\xE4mnen, f\xF6rb\xE4ttrar
      vattenkvaliteten och ger skydd \xE5t m\xE5nga djur. Dessutom motverkar de erosion.\n\n\n\n\n\nVass\n\nVass
      \xE4r en h\xF6g v\xE4xt som \nbildar t\xE4ta vassbest\xE5nd \nl\xE4ngs str\xE4nderna.
      Den \nsprider sig effektivt med \njordstammar och trivs i \nn\xE4ringsrika
      vatten."
    en: "<align=center><b>REEDS</b></align>\n\nReeds are one the most important plants
      in wetlands. They absorb nutrients, purify the water, and provide shelter for
      many animals. They also prevent erosion.\n\n\n\n\n\nCommon Reed\n\nCommon reed
      is a tall \nplant that forms dense \nstands along shorelines. \nIt spreads
      rapidly via its \nrhizomes and thrives in \nnutrient-rich waters."
